# mutgap3_res_v2_swizzles_sampled: A v2 descriptor's swizzle (a channel below 6 is Metal's MTLTextureSwizzle, 6 and above One) as sample_k reads it (Repeat, so thread i reads texel i). Four 4x1 RGBA8Unorm textures (type 2, commandType 52) over the same texels {R, G, B, A} = {11 22 33 80}, {44 55 66 40}, {77 88 99 c0}, {aa bb cc 10}: swizzle (2, 3, 4, 5) reads them as they are; (5, 3, 4, 5) puts alpha in red; (2, 6, 4, 5) reads green as One (0xff); (2, 3, 6, 5) reads blue as One.
